Package: signage-boot-disk
Version: 1
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Signage player <noreply@example.invalid>
Depends: bash, util-linux, udev
Description: Find /usr on the disk the firmware booted (initrd only)
 The install stick and an installed disk carry the same /usr and verity
 partition UUIDs. This udev rule hides the by-partuuid links of /usr and
 verity partitions on every other disk in the initrd, so usrhash= always
 resolves to the boot disk.
